{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0184_1000_p", "source_sha256": "972c163908bc3fb86bdba1e9efeb43f615bc2306ff4e7db95b7c3d3fc73716a7", "ja": "（今日は結婚式場を貸し切ってのPV撮影。エレナには\nさっそく衣装に着替えてもらったのだが……）", "zh": "（今天包下了婚礼会场进行PV拍摄。先让艾蕾娜换上了服装，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0184_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "478584c4819d112fe992dcd84094b2aad28428659867b3d16fd5133efda7a18e", "ja": "ええっ！？\n{$P$}、それ本当なノ？", "zh": "诶诶！？\n{$P$}，那是真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0184_1002_p", "source_sha256": "db29a91e0788eec613ff97921386e1b5b07be895b6347014da97cef1f5121d5a", "ja": "ああ。エレナの相手役モデルさんが、季節外れの\nインフルエンザで、来られなくなったそうだ。", "zh": "啊。听说和艾蕾娜演对手戏的模特因为得了反季节流感，没法来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0184_1003_p", "source_sha256": "34d4e4eb264d18dd36f97267e1c7b5584ce89dd496403be4084f669770569f2f", "ja": "それで、急遽俺が新郎の代役を務めることになった。\n素人相手で大変だと思うけど、よろしくな、エレナ！", "zh": "所以，临时决定由我来代替新郎。要和我这个外行搭戏，应该挺辛苦的，不过请多关照啦，艾蕾娜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0184_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "1ff889df9436acd27cbfe161677a6b2e600251492bff6a8640936cd38ffb0008", "ja": "えっ！　{$P$}が代役って……\nワタシと、結婚するノ！？", "zh": "诶！{$P$}来当替补……要和我结婚吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0184_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e9ef265fc1095e4a450698b4067b9dfb2663cf3cef3233e7bb1f560513dd10de", "ja": "ああ、代理だけどな。\n……どうかしたのか？", "zh": "啊，虽然是代替的就是了。\n……怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0184_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "475e7eaf4110fb130c4894945a1e82e156b86a51eed4d047a2c94cd320c9e4c9", "ja": "う、ううん。なんでもない。\n{$P$}と、結婚式……。", "zh": "没、没什么。\n和{$P$}的……婚礼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0184_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "1600aa5e3b4d74cb4d7d36635df78c8b0a630d10fb9ad709e81d24a8ed5cd3bb", "ja": "あ、アレ？　どうしよう……ワタシ、なんだか\nほっぺたが熱くなってきちゃったかも……。", "zh": "啊，咦？怎么办……我、好像脸颊渐渐变热了……可能……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0184_1008_p", "source_sha256": "f86255fefbbfe7f2f55dc4e2c565a1d698740697fd7b942fa93788ef562abfdc", "ja": "えっ。大丈夫か？　エレナ。\nまさかエレナもインフルエンザなんて事は……。", "zh": "咦，没事吧？艾蕾娜。\n该不会连艾蕾娜也得了流感吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0184_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "dd86ef7f1060710bd49be8c04e5026a0bd16ba1e2c7a70a16ac72546a067b989", "ja": "あっ、それは大丈夫！　ただ、\nちょっと緊張してきちゃったかも……エヘヘ。", "zh": "啊，那个没事！只是，\n好像有点紧张起来了……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0184_1010_p", "source_sha256": "797f577527cdf2956c44f036d353ced326843b032c78844c6a00f18996e8de18", "ja": "それは困ったな……\nファーストダンスの撮影、大丈夫そうか？", "zh": "那可就难办了……\n拍摄第一支舞，没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0184_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "9824089e5c9ba2e2fbeb7ca9690a74fa556576a91119c78f6694fb7821eb7eb7", "ja": "うん！　ダンスは得意だし……それに、\n{$P$}のほうが大変でしょ？", "zh": "嗯！我很擅长跳舞……而且，{$P$}才更辛苦吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0184_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "774df6a48ca670cedd294993d5dd34156c53e30adacce413093ef09899feb8fe", "ja": "ダンスは、ワタシが{$P$}を、\nエスコートしないとだもんネ？　……なんて。", "zh": "跳舞的话，当然得由我来带着{$P$}才行嘛？……开玩笑的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0184_1013_p", "source_sha256": "c0224e15766328da8ca0a54a4eab2021318106ce7d77540c27a81154f999146e", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。エレナにはいつもどおり、\nダンスと撮影を楽しんでほしい。", "zh": "啊，是啊。希望艾蕾娜像平时一样，\n享受跳舞和拍摄的乐趣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0184_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "bdd7b19c72d42382d3151848109ad87f63471856984038730c6771a7fd358660", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nうん！　わかったヨー！", "zh": "{$P$}……。\n嗯！明白啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0184_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "164f0ef0e9d4df7165b119acd4556886571d9353356140dbf3fdcfca20f02d39", "ja": "せっかく綺麗なドレスを着られたんだもん。\n楽しくダンスしないとだよネ♪", "zh": "难得穿上了这么漂亮的礼服嘛。\n当然要开心地跳舞才行呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0184_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "e917e1d03fabcdbe032b93d89b31d1c5a264fc331b0a928e97163650d5eca167", "ja": "そうだ！　ドレス、ママンたちにも見せてあげよう！\n{$P$}、写真撮ってもいい？", "zh": "对了！把礼服也给妈妈们看看吧！\n{$P$}，可以帮我拍张照片吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0184_1017_p", "source_sha256": "0ae0ca757301cc0ae8457ddc7f422f70288638289024e29dcbcdefa9f1813051", "ja": "うん、いいんじゃないか？　いつも以上に綺麗な\nエレナの写真を、たくさん送ってあげるといいよ。", "zh": "嗯，我觉得不错啊？多拍一些比平时更加漂亮的艾莲娜的照片，送给她的妈妈们吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0184_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "ba12f97210c19d35df6278848616b420db2dcbd739d4bd4e8e5ab7d8a02b21df", "ja": "えへへ……うん！\nありがと、{$P$}。", "zh": "嘿嘿……嗯！\n谢谢你，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0184_1019_018ele", "source_sha256": "fc8f1264e69efb6900e210facb107fd7047e0dcf64bf1a81b68fe93d27ec7db2", "ja": "じゃあ写真を撮ってもらうお礼に、\nファーストダンスはワタシが教えてあげるネ♪", "zh": "那作为请你帮忙拍照的答谢，\n就由我来教你第一支舞吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0184_1020_018ele", "source_sha256": "708aa8ac648d55e99872eea94f330c46bf1de6205f5af8806580a1b09b4474cf", "ja": "ワタシ、がんばるから……\nステキなPVになるといいネ♪", "zh": "我会努力的……\n希望能拍出很棒的PV呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
